"P1712835340" "This manual details the full procedure for building different types of Enhancements using Recipes and the many facets of the Workbench itself.  The worksheets, however, provide interesting characters for every other sentence.  As you read further, you notice a code and solve it:  'Be alert.  Be wary.  Believe nothing.'."

