"P2216123106" "Well, let's see what we have here...  Hmmm...  Yes, that's good.  Oh, you picked up that little tidbit, I see.  Ah!  And your personal thoughts on these worksheets are excellent.  My faith was not misplaced in you.  You have done well.  Wait, is that ink on your fingers and palm?  Honestly, {HeroName}, Emperor Cole expects a certain basic cleanliness from us, wouldn't you agree?  I didn't get to where I am by being a slob.<br><br>Anyway, the next part of your exercise is one of the best kinds of learning.  You use not only your mind, but the tools around you, to gain a greater understanding.  <color orange>Do you see that workbench over there?  Go over and build yourself an Enhancement.</color>  Here is everything you will need to build it, including the Salvage that Consultant Rupert sent over, a Common Recipe, and a bit of Information to pay for the Workbench."

